      "content": "thanks. i checked the keys and they seem fine. i'm looking at the payload now and it looks like it matches the docs perfectly. i don't think it's a rate limit thing either since we're only doing a few hits. what else could be causing a 402 specifically? is there a way to see the exact reason in the response body?",
